## [CONTEXT_SOURCES]

The following anchors provide configuration context:

- `specs/constitution.md` (Testing framework and conventions)
- Project test configuration (inferred from project files — see STEP_1)

Extract:
- Test framework mandates
- Naming conventions
- Test execution commands

